Doomsdayhero 2.0 major update
1. Unlock a new mode, "Daily Life". In this mode, you can feel the daily life of heroes and civilians, and randomly assign daily life tasks under the end of the world.
2. Added mutable car mecha hero;
3. Added shape-shifting Black Hawk Mecha Heroes;
4. Fixed enemies sometimes hitting people if they don't make their attack action;
5. Increase rewards and benefits, you can get double rewards if you pass the level;
6. Classic mode can be added to lead civilians to pass the customs, during the customs will talk with you, let the customs become more interesting;
8. Survivor model no wait time;
8. Adjust and modify UI;
9. Fix some minor bugs;
The update mainly joined the civilian clearance together, the game will not have a sense of arc alone, increased the two powerful mecha hero, can experience the pleasure of getting off and hitting zombies, black hawk fighter absolutely let you cool heaven!
